WEBVTT

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.723
And Pastor Rick
was just talking about sheep.

00:08:33.747 --> 00:08:35.446
I'm going to talk about sheep, too.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:38.453
There's a lot of serendipitous
convergence here.

00:08:39.007 --> 00:08:42.916
How clever it was of sheep
to acquire shepherds!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.273
(Laughter)

00:08:45.297 --> 00:08:47.082
Think of what this got them.

00:08:47.438 --> 00:08:49.976
They could outsource all their problems:

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.611
protection from predators,
food-finding ...

00:08:52.635 --> 00:08:53.642
(Laughter)

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:55.001
... health maintenance.

00:08:55.025 --> 00:08:56.918
(Laughter)

00:08:57.712 --> 00:09:02.500
The only cost in most flocks --
not even this -- a loss of free mating.